<h2 id="community-takes-all-of-us">COMMUNITY TAKES ALL OF US.</h2>
<p>Community grows when we show up for each other and your presence makes a difference. Intentional connection makes this a place where people belong.</p>

<h2 id="you-have-something-to-bring">YOU HAVE SOMETHING TO BRING.</h2>
<p>Your time, your gifts, and your care for others matter here. Getting involved fosters community, helps us know each more, and make room for someone new.</p>

<h2 id="lets-put-love-into-practice">LET’S PUT LOVE INTO PRACTICE.</h2>
<p>Faith takes shape in the way we care for each other. Serve a meal, join a MeetUp, or help make Sundays happen. Get connected and help turn welcome into something people can feel.</p>

<p>Let’s find your next step together. Call or text <a href="tel:+14692223617">(469) 222-3617</a> and tell us what you are interested in, such as serving in kids, youth, tech, hospitality or community meals. If you are looking for a MeetUp, you can also use the <a href="https://thetabletx.churchcenter.com/people/forms/88962">MeetUp interest form</a>.</p>
